   116|  // For `promoteAs` engines (e.g. JV), the same public SEC entities are often
   117|  // already approved/consumed by the investor engine (which runs first and
   118|  // shares the `jv_deals` discovery class). Going through `approveLead` would
   119|  // then reject every lead as "already approved" and save 0. Instead we create
